# 固定跨平台换行符：评测脚本与自动生成的报告必须保持 LF，
# 否则 CI 里的 git diff 门禁与 bash 执行都会受影响。
* text=auto

*.java       text eol=lf
*.md         text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf
*.json       text eol=lf
*.sql        text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.js         text eol=lf
*.vue        text eol=lf
*.css        text eol=lf
*.html       text eol=lf
*.sh         text eol=lf
docs/benchmark-report.md text eol=lf

# 部署相关文件必须保持 LF：CRLF 会让 .env 里的值带 \r、Dockerfile/Caddyfile 也可能出问题
.env*        text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile    text eol=lf
*.conf       text eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
